Warning: Jet.MissingAccessibleLabel: This button has no accessible label
  --> Tests/UILint/a11y_unlabeled_control.jet:5:14
    |
  5 |     node: ui.node_role("", 40.0, 10.0, ui.aria_role_button())
    |              ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Screen readers announce a control by its accessible label; an empty label is invisible to assistive tech.
 Fix: Pass a real label, e.g. `ui.node_role("Submit", w, h, ui.aria_role_button())`.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.MissingAccessibleLabel

